==English==

===Etymology===
[[respelling|Respelling]] of {{m|en|damn}} to reflect [[emphatic]] stress and a Southern US [[drawl]], in which the vowel is broken into gliding vowels.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈdæ̙jəm]|[ˈdeəjəm]|lang=en}}

===Interjection===
{{en-interj|head=dayum!}}

# {{lb|en|slang|emphatic}} {{eye dialect of|damn|from=Southern US|lang=en}}
